# Smoke-test guards: presence of each file blocks its corresponding script
# from running a second time. Delete manually if a genuine re-run is
# intended. Each real generative-call script gets its own guard filename —
# never reused across rounds, so every approved call leaves a permanent,
# distinct record.
.mindlogic-smoke-test-completed.json
.mindlogic-contract-check-completed.json
.mindlogic-smoke-test-round2-completed.json
.mindlogic-smoke-test-round3-completed.json
